OL,3,GNEWSAWest Midlands braces as flooding
OL,4,Aenters third day
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlooding misery in the West Midlands
OL,7,Fhas entered its third day, with one
OL,8,Fhigh street under water as a new wave
OL,9,Fof flood alerts are issued for the
OL,10,Fregion.
OL,12,FThere were fresh storms on Thursday
OL,13,Fevening, just hours after it was
OL,14,Fconfirmed that 55 properties had
OL,15,Fflooded in Birmingham, with other
OL,16,Fproblems from Wednesday onwards
OL,17,Fincluding evacuations of pubs, a closed
OL,18,Ftheme park, and a business that "lost
OL,19,Feverything".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
