OL,3,GNEWSAWest Midlands braces as flooding
OL,4,Aenters third day
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the latest incident, in
OL,7,FWolverhampton, flooding linked to a
OL,8,Fburst main saw Church Street, Bilston,
OL,9,Fsubmerged.
OL,11,FTwo new flood warnings issued by the
OL,12,FEnvironment Agency (EA) and covering
OL,13,Fparts of Staffordshire and Warwickshire
OL,14,Fhave since been removed, but flood
OL,15,Falerts remain for multiple areas across
OL,16,Fthe region and a Met Office weather
OL,17,Fwarning for thunder storms is in place.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
